e life ahead of him but, after leaving his fiancee's home one night, is involved in a car crash which leaves him in a coma for 5 years. When he wakes, he discovers he has an ability to see into the past, present and future life of anyone with whom he comes into physical contact.","tagline":"In his mind, he has the power to see the future. In his hands, he has the power to change it."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uggxnQRGyrHEF5p1a9jujhtXn8W.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/icvgQHxrKEDx92VQ5WHiEmEAUKH.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":11336,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uggxnQRGyrHEF5p1a9jujhtXn8W.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uggxnQRGyrHEF5p1a9jujhtXn8W.jpg","language":"it","width":1600,"height":2400},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uggxnQRGyrHEF5p1a9jujhtXn8W.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uggxnQRGyrHEF5p1a9jujhtXn8W.jpg","language":"it","width":1600,"height":2400},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6dp1STMbIPy4QUfyha3oyYTHvF2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6dp1STMbIPy4QUfyha3oyYTHvF2.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kAV4xg827u3JKAy7bCA4leU9APA.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kAV4xg827u3JKAy7bCA4leU9APA.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qam6T3oZk5cnpNUnil8ltJDFfoh.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qam6T3oZk5cnpNUnil8ltJDFfoh.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cXOn2mXccJk9BG4e74hAN2eNdvi.jpg","previewUrl":"